        <member name="T:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Protocols.Fido.Hid.FidoHidConnection">
            <summary>
            Wraps a synchronous HID IO report connection for FIDO/CTAP communication.
            Provides async interface for 64-byte FIDO HID packets.
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="M:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Protocols.Fido.Hid.FidoHidConnection.#ctor(Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Transports.Hid.IHidConnection)">
            <summary>
            Wraps a synchronous HID IO report connection for FIDO/CTAP communication.
