        <member name="T:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Protocols.Otp.Hid.IOtpHidProtocol">
            <summary>
            Protocol interface for OTP HID communication using 8-byte feature reports.
            Supports YubiKey Management operations over the OTP/Keyboard HID interface.
            </summary>
            <remarks>
                Implementations admit one full logical exchange at a time. An overlapping operation throws
                <see cref="T:System.InvalidOperationException" /> immediately. A token is checked before entry; an exchange already
                in flight runs to completion to avoid stranding the device mid-frame.
            </remarks>
        </member>
        <member name="M:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Protocols.Otp.Hid.IOtpHidProtocol.SendAndReceiveAsync(System.Byte,System.ReadOnlyMemory{System.Byte},System.Threading.CancellationToken)">
            <summary>
            Sends a slot command and receives the response.
            Used for Management application over OTP HID.
            </summary>
            <param name="slot">The slot/command byte (e.g., 0x13 for READ_CAPABILITIES).</param>
            <param name="data">The command payload (up to 64 bytes, will be padded if shorter).</param>
