                A HID code was requested that is not in this <see cref="T:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Transports.Hid.Keyboard.HidCodeTranslator" />.
            </exception>
        </member>
        <member name="P:Yubico.YubiKit.Core.Transports.Hid.Keyboard.HidCodeTranslator.Item(System.Byte)">
